# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Kramak Lite — .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Covers both the distribution repo and dogfooding scenarios.
# For user projects adopting Kramak, see docs/GETTING-STARTED.md.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Kramak Runtime State ──────────────────────────────
# Created by the agent during execution. Not shipped.
.kramak/state.json
.kramak/state.json.tmp

# ── Kramak Work Items & Plans ─────────────────────────
# Agent-generated runtime artifacts. Ignored by default
# to keep git history clean. Teams wanting full WI/plan
# traceability can remove these entries.
.kramak/work-items/*.md
!.kramak/work-items/.gitkeep
.kramak/plans/*.md
!.kramak/plans/.gitkeep

# ── Kramak Inbox ──────────────────────────────────────
# INBOX.md is the user→agent communication channel (tracked).
# Other inbox files are transient processing artifacts.
.kramak/inbox/*.md
!.kramak/inbox/INBOX.md
!.kramak/inbox/.gitkeep

# ── Kramak Cross-Session Artifacts ────────────────────
# The following are intentionally NOT ignored:
#   SESSION-LOG.md   — cross-session narrative history
#   HUMAN-TASKS.md   — human-action blockers with visibility
#   ledger/*.md      — governance audit trail for spec changes
# They persist in git for team continuity and auditability.

# ── Temporary Directories ─────────────────────────────
temp/
tmp/

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ── IDE / Editor ──────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
